<td style="width: 84.6329%;">Augustin Popa is a Senior Product Manager on the Microsoft C++ team, working across the Visual Studio IDE, Microsoft C++ (MSVC) Build Tools, and vcpkg, the cross-platform C/C++ package manager. • Follow Augustin: <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/augustinpopa/">LinkedIn</a></td>
